- Add a `supabase.auth.onAuthStateChange((event, session) => {...})` listener inside `AppShell` (or a small provider it mounts) that keeps `useSession.authed` and `useSession.profile` in sync with the *real* session — this preserves all the existing UI code that reads `useSession.authed`/`.profile` without a large refactor, but makes those values a mirror of reality instead of an independent fake.
