- Presets/marketplace/billing/notifications: 100% mock, `localStorage` only.
- Trading intelligence: rule-based heuristics only (`UniversalNode` in `apps/engine/app/nodes/universal.py`), no real LLM/ML calls despite the UI collecting model/prompt configuration for them.
- No live/paper trading execution loop — only historical/paper-slippage-adjusted/walk-forward/Monte-Carlo *backtest* simulation exists.
- No Razorpay integration of any kind.

